---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About" description="How Soulless Food gets made.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1 class="post-title">About</h1>
    <p>
      Soulless Food started in 2020 as an experiment with GPT-3. A person comes up with the name of a dish,
      however unwise. A machine takes that name at face value, works out a recipe for it, and then writes
      the heartfelt food-blog story that goes on top: the grandmother, the porch, the kids, the trip.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nobody in this process stops to ask whether the dish should exist. Every post is a small
      collaboration between people who should know better and machines that don't.
    </p>
    <p>
      These days the writing is done by Claude and the photos are generated, which means none of these
      dishes has ever existed. Please think twice before cooking any of them.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
